1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,414
Some software is allowed to fail quietly.
The systems you run are not.

2
00:00:04,514 --> 00:00:07,207
Modernization rarely fails
at the whiteboard.

3
00:00:07,247 --> 00:00:11,376
It fails in the distance between those
who plan and those who build.

4
00:00:11,476 --> 00:00:14,695
NISTA Technologies exists
to close that distance.

5
00:00:14,735 --> 00:00:19,126
We don't just describe technology —
we design it, and we build it.

6
00:00:19,226 --> 00:00:22,011
Every engagement is designed, architected,

7
00:00:22,051 --> 00:00:25,979
and delivered by engineers —
not staffed by intermediaries.

8
00:00:26,019 --> 00:00:29,786
The engineer who scopes it is
the engineer who ships it.

9
00:00:29,886 --> 00:00:33,516
Availability, integrity, and recovery
are first-class requirements —

10
00:00:33,556 --> 00:00:37,618
engineered in at the first architecture
review, not bolted on before launch.

11
00:00:37,658 --> 00:00:38,737
Never afterthoughts.

12
00:00:38,837 --> 00:00:41,062
Zero-trust posture. Hardened defaults.

13
00:00:41,102 --> 00:00:45,113
Secure development lifecycle —
across seven engineering disciplines,

14
00:00:45,153 --> 00:00:48,490
from artificial intelligence
to cloud and cybersecurity.

15
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:51,159
Registered, active, and contract-ready —

16
00:00:51,199 --> 00:00:54,396
across federal, state, local,
and prime programs.

17
00:00:54,496 --> 00:00:58,345
NISTA Technologies. Intelligent software
for mission-critical organizations.

18
00:00:58,385 --> 00:00:59,716
Modernize with confidence.
